\n    .section {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .subsection {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-left: 8px;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n    }\n    .blood-types {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      margin-left: 42px;\n      margin-top: -1px;\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .plasma {\n      width: 105px;\n      padding-top: 13px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .cells {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-width: 295px;\n    }\n    .cells-label {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      padding-top: 13px;\n      margin-right: 2px;\n    }\n    .small-brace {\n      font-size: 61px;\n      font-family: serif;\n      line-height: .72;\n      transform: scaleX(.56);\n      margin-right: 3px;\n    }\n    .cell-list {\n      padding-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 17px;\n    }\n    .indent1 { margin-left: 13px; }\n    .indent2 { margin-left: 28px; }\n    .blue { color: #183f85; }\n    .compact { font-size: 14px; }\n    .item-title {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      margin-left: 8px;\n    }\n    .item-title b { font-weight: bold; }\n    .bottom-cut {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"paper\">\n    <div class=\"line title\">§ 4.5体内物质的运输</div>\n\n    <div class=\"cycle\">\n      <div class=\"cycle-name\">血液循环系统</div>\n      <div class=\"brace\">⎧<br>⎩</div>\n      <div class=\"cycle-items\">血液<br>心脏<br>血管</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line section\">一、血液（约占体重的7%～8%）</div>\n    <div class=\"line subsection\">1．血液（血浆55%）　水、无机盐、葡萄糖、氧气、尿素等　<span class=\"blue\">运输血细胞，运输养料和废物</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"blood-types\">\n      <div class=\"plasma\">血浆（55%）</div>\n      <div class=\"cells\">\n        <div class=\"cells-label\">血细胞（45%）</div>\n        <div class=\"small-brace\">⎧<br>⎪<br>⎩</div>\n        <div class=\"cell-list\">红细胞<br>白细胞<br>血小板</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line indent2\">一次失血超过体内血量的<span class=\"blue\">30%</span>，就会危及生命</div>\n\n    <div class=\"item-title\"><b>2．红细胞</b></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(1)形态　双凹圆盘状，呈两面凹圆盘形，<span class=\"blue\">增加表面积，携氧</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(2)数量　正常男性平均为$5.0\\times10^6/\\mathrm{mm}^3$</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">　　　　正常女性平均为$4.2\\times10^6/\\mathrm{mm}^3$</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(3)功能　<span class=\"blue\">运输氧气和部分二氧化碳</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(4)红细胞的特点：在氧浓度高的地方容易结合，在氧浓度低的地方容易与氧分离</div>\n\n    <div class=\"item-title\"><b>3．白细胞</b></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(1)形态　较大，有细胞核，形状比红细胞大</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(2)数量　一般在4000～10000个/mm³（血液被细菌感染）</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(3)功能　<span class=\"blue\">吞噬侵入人体内的细菌、病毒等异物</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(4)功能　<span class=\"blue\">有些白细胞能穿过毛细血管壁，主要是能变形运动和吞噬活动，并有免疫功能</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">　　　（数量可与红细胞数量比为1：600）但有参考</div>\n\n    <div class=\"item-title\"><b>4．血小板</b></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(1)形态：形状不规则，无细胞核，很小</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">　　　直径约2～4μm，在骨髓有巨细胞时产生，是血液中最小的有形成分</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(2)数量　正常成人10万～30万/mm³</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">(3)功能：<span class=\"blue\">加速血液凝固，防止大量出血和血液外溢</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"item-title\"><b>5．人体血细胞寿命和再生</b></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">红细胞　寿命短，衰退死亡，就是贫血</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">白细胞　寿命日增多，就是身体健康</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">血小板　寿命也短，不能再生</div>\n\n    <div class=\"item-title\"><b>6．血细胞寿命</b></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2 compact\">血细胞都有一定的寿命。红细胞寿命约为120天，大约60天后红细胞逐渐衰老，红细胞具有[illegible]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-cut\">7．血液的功能</div>\n  </main>\n<